load @term/seed/code/algebra/banach
  find banach-algebra

# A C-star algebra: a Banach algebra with an involution (a conjugate-transpose) satisfying the C-star identity, the norm
# of an element times its involution equals the norm squared. It is the abstract algebra of bounded operators on a
# Hilbert space, the mathematical home of quantum observables. The form carries the underlying Banach algebra; the
# involution and the C-star identity are the added structure.
form c-star-algebra
  link algebra, like banach-algebra
